# Packages of the amd64-efi target, on top of profiles/base/packages: Debian's
# amd64 kernel and GRUB's environment tool (RAUC's grub backend).
linux-image-amd64
grub-common
# The Secure Boot chain (ADR-0011), which build/mkimage.sh copies onto the
# FLOCKOS partition: Debian's shim, signed by Microsoft; MokManager, which
# shim starts when a check fails; Debian's signed GRUB. Debian's kernels are
# signed already. Listed here so packages.tsv and the SBOM carry them.
shim-signed
shim-helpers-amd64-signed
grub-efi-amd64-signed
# fwupd's UEFI capsule helper, signed by Debian: capsule updates (lane 3)
# also start with Secure Boot on.
fwupd-amd64-signed
